{'symbol': 'FDX', 'date': '2022-08-09 07:00:00', 'title': 'FEDEX OFFICE PILOTS FORD E-TRANSIT VANS FOR FEDEX SAMEDAY® CITY SERVICE', 'text': 'PLANO, TEXAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FEDEX OFFICE, A WORLD-CLASS PROVIDER OF CONVENIENT, STATE-OF-THE-ART PRINTING, PACKING AND SHIPPING SERVICES AND SUBSIDIARY OF FEDEX CORP. (NYSE: FDX), IN COLLABORATION WITH FORD PRO, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT IS PILOTING TEN FORD E-TRANSIT VANS ACROSS ITS FEDEX SAMEDAY CITY NETWORK AS PART OF THE GOAL TO TRANSITION ITS ENTIRE PICKUP AND DELIVERY FLEET TO ZERO TAILPIPE EMISSION VEHICLES BY 2040 IN ALIGNMENT WITH THE OVERALL FLEET ELECTRIFICATION GOAL FOR FEDEX. FEDEX SAM'}